# Customer sample payloads stay local; keep only their explanatory document.
/request/web操作采集需求/samples/*
!/request/web操作采集需求/samples/样例说明.md

# Local regression projections from real captures are evidence, not pure fixtures.
/projects/code/tests/fixtures/

# Persistent local SQLite projects, configuration and source evidence.
/database/**
!/database/README.md
